# Restructuring an outline: collapse all, open one project, zoom in, move a task out to a sibling project, zoom out, then undo three steps back past an unwanted indent and redo one.
file <<END
Garden:
	- Buy seeds
	- Water plants
	- Fix the fence
Kitchen:
